<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Misawa -96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Misawa -96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 30.77		vs	   25.31</p>
<p> Operating	   70    million	  vs	   29    million</p>
<p> Current	    195    million	  vs	  153    million</p>
<p> Net		   88    million	  vs	   53    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.59 yen	  vs	    4.57 yen</p>
